/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/faa9f03d/7/code.py:193:    Repair a thin colored line network by recoloring singleton markers, filling rectilinear gaps, redirecting yellow-controlled arms, and rendering pink-prioritized crossings as a checkerboard alternation.
